OL,3,AWe couldn't afford a house alone, so we
OL,4,Abought one with strangers
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We wanted a house with a yard that
OL,7,Fcould fit a trampoline, in a walkable
OL,8,Fneighbourhood, but we couldn't afford
OL,9,Fit," says Elizabeth, a project manager
OL,10,Fin the healthcare sector.
